# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

A vault x509 certificate: a PEM-encoded certificate on its own, without a private key, versioned. Use it to distribute CA certificates, client trust anchors or signed certificates; for a certificate with its key, use `bahriya_tls_bundle`. Changing `cert` creates a new version and makes it current. The certificate details (`subject`, `issuer`, `expires` and the rest) are read from the certificate and returned on every read.

A container mounts its x509 certificates in `vault.x509_certs`.

